{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>July 1799 \u2014 Moha, Belgium.</strong><br>The village priest, Nicolas Richelle, has been found tortured and murdered in his own rectory. The investigation points to a dark trail of secrets and rivalries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Captain Gr\u00e9goire Lef\u00e8bvre, a mounted gendarmerie officer on his first mission in the region. Tasked with solving this shocking crime, you must navigate between friends and foes, uncover hidden motives, and face the shadowy past of the victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Was it greed? Revenge? Or something even more sinister? What role did the hot-tempered Chevalier de M\u00e9lotte play in the tragedy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every clue could bring you closer to the truth\u2026 if you dare to look beyond appearances.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical mystery</strong> \u2014 Explore real locations in Belgium during the French Directory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate &amp; deduce</strong> \u2014 Question witnesses, search for clues, and piece the puzzle together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely voiced in French by professional voice actors\u00a0</strong>\u2014 Experience an authentic, immersive atmosphere with English &amp; French subtitles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the novel <i>Le Serment de Haine</i></strong>\u00a0by Catherine Lheureux\u2014 Captain Lef\u00e8bvre\u2019s first case.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdd <i>Add to your wishlist to support the project!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111040?t=1768431661","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111040?t=1768431661","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111040/4d8f378b2